{"4832630":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Royale Smith","steam_appid":4832630,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5056160],"detailed_description":"<h1>THE KINGDOM AWAITS YOU<\/h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On this journey you embark on as a novice blacksmith, your ultimate goal is the kingdom. A loyal blacksmith devoted to the king will never fall. Plus, palace events will be awaiting you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832630\/extras\/c7df5b2a06a1e896d349eb254f781daa.poster.avif?t=1793675855\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832630\/extras\/c7df5b2a06a1e896d349eb254f781daa.webm?t=1793675855\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832630\/extras\/c7df5b2a06a1e896d349eb254f781daa.mp4?t=1793675855\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><\/p><br><h1>LEARN THE RECIPES OF LEGENDARY ITEMS<\/h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legendary swords, axes, daggers, arrows, bows, maces, and spears—all await to be forged by you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832630\/extras\/2a730aeb6dcf3f4e73e0bb6e7b7c48a3.poster.avif?t=1793675855\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832630\/extras\/2a730aeb6dcf3f4e73e0bb6e7b7c48a3.webm?t=1793675855\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832630\/extras\/2a730aeb6dcf3f4e73e0bb6e7b7c48a3.mp4?t=1793675855\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><\/p><br><h1>CUSTOMERS<\/h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aside from the local peasants, some pretty weird customers will be dropping by your shop.<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Archers: They’ll be demanding bows and arrows. Make sure you forge the absolute best for them. Make sure of it, so they keep coming back for more.<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Assassins: These guys are total maniacs. They literally do nothing but ask for daggers. Word of advice: just don't make a peep.<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Knights: You can smell their nobility just from the way they walk—actually, they can barely walk from all that heavy armor. They'll ask for all kinds of stuff like swords, axes, spears, and maces. Don't hold anything back; we don't want to get on their bad side for no reason.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832630\/extras\/e4ad2bf1ccbb0ff5c2693bafcb58480d.poster.avif?t=1793675855\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832630\/extras\/e4ad2bf1ccbb0ff5c2693bafcb58480d.webm?t=1793675855\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832630\/extras\/e4ad2bf1ccbb0ff5c2693bafcb58480d.mp4?t=1793675855\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On top of that, there are special event customers. They might ask for some unique stuff, so stay on your toes and get ready.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Japanese: <\/strong>Super friendly folk, but man, you do NOT want to cross them. Fulfilling their requests will take you a long way.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pirates: <\/strong>Totally unpredictable, you gotta watch your back. Don't leave your anvil unattended or they might just pocket the whole thing.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Egyptians:<\/strong> Heaven knows how they made it all the way out here. Traveling that far sounds like pure torture. Let's just put on a friendly face anyway.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vikings:<\/strong> Give 'em a solid piece of gear and they're the happiest people alive. Keep on their good side and they’ll visit often. As for the alternative... well, you really don't want to find out.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832630\/extras\/20c1a2f0185bd0ab869d554be8165a19.poster.avif?t=1793675855\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832630\/extras\/20c1a2f0185bd0ab869d554be8165a19.webm?t=1793675855\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832630\/extras\/20c1a2f0185bd0ab869d554be8165a19.mp4?t=1793675855\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><\/p><br><h1>EVENTS<\/h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While days fly by like water, don't forget to keep an eye on the calendar. Special events can pop up on certain days of the year. A market gets set up in the kingdom, featuring exclusive items for sale during the event. Be sure to check those out—there might be some stuff you’ll want to hoard. Just saying!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832630\/extras\/890421f890f6fd2b74f467a9b97f7aa7.poster.avif?t=1793675855\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832630\/extras\/890421f890f6fd2b74f467a9b97f7aa7.webm?t=1793675855\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832630\/extras\/890421f890f6fd2b74f467a9b97f7aa7.mp4?t=1793675855\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><\/p><br><h1>ROYALE SMITH<\/h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't go thinking, &quot;So what if I become the royale blacksmith, will my ego magically reach the heavens?&quot; In this kingdom, no good deed goes unpunished... uh, I mean, unrewarded. They will literally drown a man in gold up to his throat. If you haven't gotten sick of the game by the time you reach this stage, well, you might just get sick of it after this. Then again, every level is a fresh start, so keep grinding without giving up. After all, you've made it to the endgame; having to create a brand-new save file might feel like an absolute nightmare, but hey, what do I know?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832630\/extras\/c487b8085cd966963ad110bbc4681793.poster.avif?t=1793675855\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832630\/extras\/c487b8085cd966963ad110bbc4681793.webm?t=1793675855\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832630\/extras\/c487b8085cd966963ad110bbc4681793.mp4?t=1793675855\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><\/p><br><h1>TRADE SHIP<\/h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to this ship, you can reach markets in distant lands. It appears at the port at the beginning of each week and asks for dozens of products. Complete them on time, and you can make yourself a fortune with a sack full of gold.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832630\/extras\/5adf6bf58bef189cd9d05b36141a781a.poster.avif?t=1793675855\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832630\/extras\/5adf6bf58bef189cd9d05b36141a781a.webm?t=1793675855\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832630\/extras\/5adf6bf58bef189cd9d05b36141a781a.mp4?t=1793675855\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><\/p><br><h1>MINING<\/h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are ore deposits scattered around that you can mine. Don't hesitate to gather them!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832630\/extras\/e83bba83bbe7d48b4f4929ef5dedcf72.poster.avif?t=1793675855\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832630\/extras\/e83bba83bbe7d48b4f4929ef5dedcf72.webm?t=1793675855\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832630\/extras\/e83bba83bbe7d48b4f4929ef5dedcf72.mp4?t=1793675855\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><\/p><br><h1>About the Game<\/h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On this journey starting as a novice blacksmith in the Middle Ages, customers from various classes will visit your shop. You can read their dialogues and fulfill their requests. They will demand items in three different rarities: common, rare, and legendary. Delivering orders on time will grant you fame, experience, and gold. With your earnings, you can learn new crafting recipes, expand your shop, and decorate it.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On this journey starting as a novice blacksmith in the Middle Ages, customers from various classes will visit your shop. You can read their dialogues and fulfill their requests. They will demand items in three different rarities: common, rare, and legendary. Delivering orders on time will grant you fame, experience, and gold. With your earnings, you can learn new crafting recipes, expand your shop, and decorate it.<\/p>","short_description":"Open your shop as a novice blacksmith and raise your reputation all the way to royalty. Assassins, archers, knights, and peasants will visit your shop as customers, demanding common, rare, or legendary swords, axes, daggers, bows, arrows, and various other goods.","supported_languages":"English, French, German, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Turkish, Italian, Spanish - Spain","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832630\/6d2ed59324916d5e98bc744e486935e4dca1cbd7\/header.jpg?t=1793675855","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832630\/524fe7cc9e35aeac4aa83aec238abfe678f4e177\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793675855","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832630\/524fe7cc9e35aeac4aa83aec238abfe678f4e177\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793675855","website":"https:\/\/www.poisonmush.com\/","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3 3000 or later<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 660<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":[" Poison Mushroom Interactive"],"publishers":[" Poison Mushroom Interactive"],"demos":[{"appid":5056160,"description":""}],"price_overview":{"currency":"EUR","initial":1016,"final":914,"discount_percent":10,"initial_formatted":"10,16€","final_formatted":"9,14€"},"packages":[1679010],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Royale Smith","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1679010,"percent_savings_text":"-10% ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"Royale Smith - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">10,16€<\/span> 9,14€","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":914}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":1,"description":"Multi-player"},{"id":9,"description":"Co-op"},{"id":38,"description":"Online Co-op"},{"id":68,"description":"Custom Volume Controls"},{"id":74,"description":"Playable without Timed Input"},{"id":23,"description":"Steam Cloud"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"4","description":"Casual"},{"id":"23","description":"Indie"},{"id":"28","description":"Simulation"},{"id":"70","description":"Early Access"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832630\/fab16dbfc4a48326afe1c2881363b81a31fc2a93\/ss_fab16dbfc4a48326afe1c2881363b81a31fc2a93.600x338.jpg?t=1793675855","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832630\/fab16dbfc4a48326afe1c2881363b81a31fc2a93\/ss_fab16dbfc4a48326afe1c2881363b81a31fc2a93.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793675855"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832630\/ed173edac464d67f65ae8f0256d0a522551ec21f\/ss_ed173edac464d67f65ae8f0256d0a522551ec21f.600x338.jpg?t=1793675855","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832630\/ed173edac464d67f65ae8f0256d0a522551ec21f\/ss_ed173edac464d67f65ae8f0256d0a522551ec21f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793675855"},{"id":2,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832630\/10d485d2341426d47914e4a3bab279cacfd42119\/ss_10d485d2341426d47914e4a3bab279cacfd42119.600x338.jpg?t=1793675855","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832630\/10d485d2341426d47914e4a3bab279cacfd42119\/ss_10d485d2341426d47914e4a3bab279cacfd42119.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793675855"},{"id":3,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832630\/c66902ac33f91d366f5e2495467e33f5d1739524\/ss_c66902ac33f91d366f5e2495467e33f5d1739524.600x338.jpg?t=1793675855","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832630\/c66902ac33f91d366f5e2495467e33f5d1739524\/ss_c66902ac33f91d366f5e2495467e33f5d1739524.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793675855"},{"id":4,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832630\/e5ca277127b31a13eab0f92c65aa49e87719bb41\/ss_e5ca277127b31a13eab0f92c65aa49e87719bb41.600x338.jpg?t=1793675855","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832630\/e5ca277127b31a13eab0f92c65aa49e87719bb41\/ss_e5ca277127b31a13eab0f92c65aa49e87719bb41.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793675855"},{"id":5,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832630\/dbfe91a56ecd821e0d5c43f5c536a24b1e7c85c0\/ss_dbfe91a56ecd821e0d5c43f5c536a24b1e7c85c0.600x338.jpg?t=1793675855","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4832630\/dbfe91a56ecd821e0d5c43f5c536a24b1e